// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// daogu-cloth.c 花格道袍

#include <armor.h>
#include <ansi.h>

inherit CLOTH;

void create()
{
	set_name(HIM"花格道袍"NOR, ({"pao", "cloth", "dao pao"}) );
	set_weight(3000);
	if( clonep() )
		set_default_object(__FILE__);
	else {
		set("unit", "件");
		set("value", 0);
		set("long", "一件普普通通的花格道袍。\n");
		set("material", "cloth");
		set("armor_prop/armor", 2);
		set("female_only", 1);
	}
	setup();
}
int query_autoload() { return 1; }